<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
  <tr>
    <td width="24" valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.4;padding:0;white-space:nowrap;">•</td>
    <td valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;padding:0 0 0 4px;">
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 4px 0;">Retail &amp; Lifestyle</div>
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Tourist-heavy malls, Orchard Road, Jewel, Bugis, pop-ups. Capture Malaysian footfall more effectively.</div>
