    <td valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;padding:0 0 0 4px;">
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 4px 0;">F&amp;B &amp; Hospitality</div>
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Restaurants, cafés, bars, hotels, and attractions serving Malaysian visitors daily.</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
  <tr>
    <td width="24" valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.4;padding:0;white-space:nowrap;">•</td>
    <td valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;padding:0 0 0 4px;">
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 4px 0;">Education &amp; Training</div>
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Collect tuition and course fees from Malaysian students in MYR without operational complexity.</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:0;">
  <tr>
    <td width="24" valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.4;padding:0;white-space:nowrap;">•</td>
    <td valign="top" style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;padding:0 0 0 4px;">
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 4px 0;">E-commerce Brands</div>
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Singapore-based brands shipping to Malaysia can offer a fully local checkout experience, without setting up a Malaysian entity.</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table></mj-raw>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 24px">
